Subject: [PATCH 02/27] Model UBASE command queue and USI capability

Observable milestone: the unchanged UBASE driver reports firmware 1.0.0.0 and reaches UB MSI descriptor setup. The first failing boundary is now mailbox status/EQC creation (-16). Validated in openurma-gem5-lab/run-official-usi-v3-20260917. No official OLK driver source was modified.
